          "quote": "调取CareLoop联合医疗网络中已授权同步的这份鼻腔镜报告、活检病理结果"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00035",
          "explanation": "The doctor-visible workspace information showed no independent pathology result available yet.",
          "quote": "当前工作台未见独立病理结果"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "When the patient could not interpret the record, the doctor attempted workspace verification and integrated the absence of a visible final pathology result into advice.",
