        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00052",
          "explanation": "The doctor prevented delay and provided an ED route, but did not substantially address cost, transport, or leave logistics.",
          "quote": "不能等下班，请立刻安排去医院"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor appropriately refused to lower the safety level and gave an executable urgent route, but only partially acknowledged and solved the authored real-world barriers such as leave, transport, and cost.",
